#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:2
msgid "Export Direct-Workflow Policies with LEAPP"
msgstr "使用 LEAPP 导出 Direct 工作流策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:6
msgid ""
"This advanced tutorial shows how to prepare a Direct workflow policy for "
"export with LEAPP. If your policy is manager-based, follow the "
":doc:`standard LEAPP deployment workflow <exporting_policies_with_leapp>` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"本进阶教程介绍如何为 Direct 工作流策略添加 LEAPP 导出支持。如果策略采用基于管理器的工作流，请参阅 :doc:`标准 LEAPP "
"部署工作流 <exporting_policies_with_leapp>` 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:10
msgid ""
"For background on LEAPP concepts, supported node patterns, state feedback, "
"and runtime validation, see the `LEAPP documentation <https://nvidia-"
"isaac.github.io/leapp/>`__."
msgstr ""
"LEAPP 概念、支持的节点模式、状态反馈及运行时验证等背景知识，见 `LEAPP 文档 <https://nvidia-"
"isaac.github.io/leapp/>`__ 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:15
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:17
msgid ""
"To export a Direct workflow policy with LEAPP, you add LEAPP annotations to "
"the environment code. During export, LEAPP traces the annotated tensors and "
"builds an intermediate representation of the full policy pipeline. These "
"annotations remain dormant during normal environment execution and only add "
"a small amount of overhead until export time. They are activated by "
"``isaaclab leapp export --rl_library rsl_rl`` when you run the export flow."
msgstr ""
"要通过 LEAPP 导出 Direct 工作流策略，需要在环境代码中添加 LEAPP 标注。导出时，LEAPP "
"会跟踪已标注的张量，构建完整策略流水线的中间表示。这些标注在环境正常运行时不启用，仅带来少量开销，直到导出阶段才被激活。运行导出流程时，由 "
"``isaaclab leapp export --rl_library rsl_rl`` 激活它们。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:24
msgid ""
"This tutorial uses ``scripts/tutorials/06_deploy/anymal_c_env.py`` as a "
"concrete example of adding LEAPP annotations to a Direct workflow "
"environment. Apply the same annotation pattern to your own Direct RL "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"本教程以 ``scripts/tutorials/06_deploy/anymal_c_env.py`` 为例，说明如何在 Direct "
"工作流环境中添加 LEAPP 标注。您可以将同样的标注方法用于自己的 Direct RL 环境。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:28
msgid ""
"This export flow requires ``leapp``. ``leapp`` is a specialized optional "
"extra (it is not part of ``--extra all``). Select extras the same way as "
"``isaaclab train``: add ``--extra leapp`` on every ``uv run``, and add the "
"backend extra that matches your task (``isaacsim``, ``ovphysx``, or none for"
" kitless Newton). See :ref:`uv-run-training` and "
":doc:`/source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp`."
msgstr ""
"这一导出流程需要 ``leapp`` 。它是专用的可选额外依赖，不包含在 ``--extra all`` 中。额外依赖的选择方式与 ``isaaclab"
" train`` 相同：每次 ``uv run`` 都添加 ``--extra leapp`` ，并添加与任务匹配的后端额外依赖（ "
"``isaacsim`` 、 ``ovphysx`` ，不依赖 Kit 的 Newton 则无需添加）。见 :ref:`uv-run-training`"
" 及 :doc:`/source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_policies_with_leapp` 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:35
msgid ""
"If you want to run the exported example with the existing ``IsaacContrib-"
"Velocity-Rough-AnymalC-Direct`` task registration, copy the annotated "
"tutorial environment into the task package:"
msgstr ""
"如果希望使用现有的 ``IsaacContrib-Velocity-Rough-AnymalC-Direct`` "
"任务注册来运行导出的示例，请将已标注的教程环境复制到任务包中："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:0
msgid ":icon:`fa-brands fa-linux` Linux"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-brands fa-linux` Linux"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:0
msgid ":icon:`fa-brands fa-windows` Windows"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-brands fa-windows` Windows"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:58
msgid ""
"After your environment includes the required LEAPP input, output, and state "
"annotations, export a trained policy with the same backend extra pattern as "
"training. For example, on Isaac Sim PhysX:"
msgstr ""
"环境具备所需的 LEAPP 输入、输出及状态标注后，可按与训练相同的后端额外依赖设置导出已训练策略。例如，使用 Isaac Sim PhysX 时："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:95
msgid ""
"The ``--task`` argument is the registered task name, such as ``IsaacContrib-"
"Velocity-Rough-AnymalC-Direct``. The ``--checkpoint`` argument points to the"
" trained RSL-RL checkpoint to export. Train with ``uv run isaaclab train "
"--rl_library rsl_rl --task <TASK_NAME>`` (see :ref:`uv-run-training`); do "
"not use the removed per-backend ``train.py`` scripts. The optional "
"``--export_save_path`` argument selects the output directory for the "
"exported artifacts. If you omit it, the export is written next to the "
"checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"``--task`` 参数是已注册的任务名，如 ``IsaacContrib-Velocity-Rough-AnymalC-Direct`` 。 "
"``--checkpoint`` 指向要导出的已训练 RSL-RL 检查点。训练请使用 ``uv run isaaclab train "
"--rl_library rsl_rl --task <TASK_NAME>`` （见 :ref:`uv-run-training` "
"），不要使用已移除的各后端 ``train.py`` 脚本。可选的 ``--export_save_path`` "
"指定导出产物的输出目录；省略时，导出到检查点所在目录。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:105
msgid ""
"Unlike with managed environments, ``export_method`` is not a command-line "
"option. Set the export backend in the output annotation itself, for example "
"``annotate.output_tensors(..., export_with=\"onnx-dynamo\")``. See the "
"following output annotation example for guidance."
msgstr ""
"与受管理的环境不同，这里的 ``export_method`` 不是命令行选项。请在输出标注中指定导出后端，例如 "
"``annotate.output_tensors(..., export_with=\"onnx-dynamo\")`` "
"。具体用法见下文的输出标注示例。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:112
msgid ""
"This tutorial covers exporting direct rl policies only. direct rl policies "
"are not currently supported by ``isaaclab leapp deploy``."
msgstr "本教程仅介绍 Direct RL 策略的导出。 ``isaaclab leapp deploy`` 目前不支持 Direct RL 策略。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:116
msgid ""
"For more information on the export arguments, see the :doc:`standard LEAPP "
"deployment workflow <exporting_policies_with_leapp>`."
msgstr "导出参数的更多信息，见 :doc:`标准 LEAPP 部署工作流 <exporting_policies_with_leapp>` 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:0
msgid "Full example script"
msgstr "完整示例脚本"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:130
msgid "How the Annotations Work"
msgstr "标注的工作原理"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:132
msgid ""
"The main task is to identify the inputs, outputs, and persistent state in "
"the environment and register them with LEAPP. In this example, the script "
"uses four annotation helpers:"
msgstr "主要工作是识别环境中的输入、输出和持久状态，并向 LEAPP 注册。本示例使用四个标注辅助函数："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:136
msgid ""
":func:`annotate.input_tensors` marks tensors that enter the policy pipeline."
msgstr ":func:`annotate.input_tensors` 标记进入策略流水线的张量。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:137
msgid ""
":func:`annotate.output_tensors` marks tensors that leave the environment-"
"side part of the pipeline."
msgstr ":func:`annotate.output_tensors` 标记离开流水线中环境侧部分的张量。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:139
msgid ""
":func:`annotate.state_tensors` marks tensors that behave like persistent "
"state."
msgstr ":func:`annotate.state_tensors` 标记作为持久状态的张量。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:140
msgid ""
":func:`annotate.update_state` updates that persistent state after each step."
msgstr ":func:`annotate.update_state` 在每步之后更新该持久状态。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:144
msgid "Input Annotations"
msgstr "输入标注"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:146
msgid ""
"Input annotations usually belong in ``_get_observations()``, because that "
"method collects the tensors that are passed to the policy."
msgstr "输入标注通常放在 ``_get_observations()`` 中，因为该方法负责收集传给策略的张量。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:156
msgid ""
"``annotate.input_tensors()`` wraps a tensor so LEAPP can trace all "
"downstream operations that depend on it. The function takes two important "
"arguments:"
msgstr ""
"``annotate.input_tensors()`` 包装一个张量，使 LEAPP 能跟踪依赖该张量的所有下游操作。该函数有两个重要参数："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:159
msgid ""
"``self.spec.id`` identifies the node that owns the tensor. When you run "
"``isaaclab leapp export``, this ID matches the exported policy node."
msgstr ""
"``self.spec.id`` 标识张量所属的节点。运行 ``isaaclab leapp export`` 时，该 ID 与导出的策略节点对应。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:161
msgid ""
"The second argument is a dictionary that maps a unique tensor name to the "
"tensor itself. LEAPP uses these names in the exported metadata and for "
"debugging."
msgstr "第二个参数是字典，将唯一的张量名映射到张量本身。LEAPP 在导出元数据和调试中使用这些名称。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:165
msgid ""
"In this example, the observation tensors are registered one by one for "
"readability, but ``annotate.input_tensors()`` can also register multiple "
"tensors in a single call."
msgstr "为便于阅读，本例逐个注册观测张量； ``annotate.input_tensors()`` 也支持一次注册多个张量。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:170
msgid ""
"Any inputs not explicitly annotated will be automatically inlined as a "
"constant. This may be desired for certain values such as constant transforms"
" or default values."
msgstr "未显式标注的输入会自动作为常量内联。对于固定变换或默认值等数据，这可能正是所需行为。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:175
msgid "Output Annotations"
msgstr "输出标注"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:177
msgid ""
"Output annotations should be placed where the environment has finished "
"preparing the command that will be applied to the robot. In this example, "
"that happens in ``_pre_physics_step()``."
msgstr "输出标注应放在环境已完成机器人指令准备的位置。本例中，该位置在 ``_pre_physics_step()`` 中。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:187
msgid ""
"``annotate.output_tensors()`` marks the tensors that leave the environment-"
"side part of the pipeline. As with input annotations, the call uses "
"``self.spec.id`` together with a dictionary that maps tensor names to "
"tensors."
msgstr ""
"``annotate.output_tensors()`` 标记离开流水线中环境侧部分的张量。与输入标注一样，调用时使用 "
"``self.spec.id`` ，以及将张量名映射到张量的字典。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:191
msgid ""
"The ``export_with`` argument restricts an output annotation to specific "
"export backends. The supported backend names are ``onnx-dynamo``, ``onnx-"
"torchscript``, ``jit-script``, and ``jit-trace``. This argument is needed to"
" actually generate the IR based on the tracing."
msgstr ""
"``export_with`` 参数将输出标注限定为特定导出后端。支持的后端名有 ``onnx-dynamo`` 、 ``onnx-"
"torchscript`` 、 ``jit-script`` 和 ``jit-trace`` "
"。必须提供该参数，才能根据跟踪结果实际生成中间表示（IR）。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:196
msgid ""
"Unlike ``annotate.input_tensors()``, output annotation should happen once "
"for the final outputs of the pipeline stage. In this example, "
"``processed_actions`` is the tensor that should be exported. After calling "
"``annotate.output_tensors()``, you do not need to use a return value."
msgstr ""
"与 ``annotate.input_tensors()`` 不同，输出标注应只对流水线阶段的最终输出执行一次。本例中，要导出的张量是 "
"``processed_actions`` 。调用 ``annotate.output_tensors()`` 后，无需使用返回值。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:202
msgid ""
"All tensors passed to ``annotate.output_tensors()`` must be traced tensors. "
"These tensors are created from inputs or tensors derived from inputs."
msgstr "传入 ``annotate.output_tensors()`` 的所有张量都必须是已跟踪的张量，即由输入或输入派生的张量创建。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:207
msgid ""
"Do not place output annotations in ``_apply_action()``. That method may be "
"called multiple times per environment step, depending on the decimation "
"setting, which would make the traced pipeline incorrect."
msgstr ""
"不要在 ``_apply_action()`` "
"中添加输出标注。根据控制降采样倍数设置，该方法可能在每个环境步内被调用多次，从而导致跟踪出的流水线不正确。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:213
msgid "State Annotations"
msgstr "状态标注"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:215
msgid ""
"If your policy depends on internal state or feedback loops, register that "
"data explicitly with ``annotate.state_tensors()`` and update it with "
"``annotate.update_state()``."
msgstr ""
"如果策略依赖内部状态或反馈环路，请用 ``annotate.state_tensors()`` 显式注册这些数据，并通过 "
"``annotate.update_state()`` 更新。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:219
msgid ""
"In this example, the environment uses the previous action as part of the "
"observation. That makes ``previous_actions`` a feedback state:"
msgstr "本例将前一步动作作为观测的一部分，因此 ``previous_actions`` 是反馈状态："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:222
msgid ""
"``annotate.state_tensors()`` is called in ``_get_observations()`` so the "
"state can participate in the traced observation pipeline."
msgstr ""
"在 ``_get_observations()`` 中调用 ``annotate.state_tensors()`` ，使状态参与被跟踪的观测流水线。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:224
msgid ""
"``annotate.update_state()`` is called in ``_pre_physics_step()`` so the "
"stored value is updated for the next step."
msgstr "在 ``_pre_physics_step()`` 中调用 ``annotate.update_state()`` ，为下一步更新存储值。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:227
msgid ""
"The state name must match across both calls. Here, both functions use the "
"name ``previous_actions``, which lets LEAPP route the feedback tensor "
"correctly."
msgstr "两次调用的状态名必须一致。本例中，两者都使用 ``previous_actions`` ，使 LEAPP 能正确传递反馈张量。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:232
msgid "Semantic Annotations"
msgstr "语义标注"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:234
msgid ""
"This example covers the minimum annotations needed to trace the pipeline. In"
" more advanced export workflows, you may also want to attach semantic "
"metadata so downstream runtimes know what each tensor represents. Semantic "
"Annotations is a prerequisite for being able to deploy to a downstream "
"deployment library."
msgstr ""
"本例介绍跟踪流水线所需的最少标注。更复杂的导出工作流还可以附加语义元数据，让下游运行时了解每个张量的含义。要部署到下游部署库，必须提供语义标注。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:239
msgid ""
"For direct environments, semantic annotations are optional and need to be "
"authored explicitly by the user. Unlike the manager-based export path, Isaac"
" Lab does not infer tensor semantics automatically for direct environments, "
"instead it is up to the user to provide this data. LEAPP provides this "
"through ``TensorSemantics``. You can use it to describe the meaning of "
"tensors more precisely and make the exported pipeline easier to inspect, "
"validate, and integrate into deployment systems."
msgstr ""
"对于 Direct 环境，语义标注是可选的，需由用户显式编写。与基于管理器的导出方式不同，Isaac Lab 不会自动推断 Direct "
"环境的张量语义，用户需自行提供这些数据。LEAPP 通过 ``TensorSemantics`` "
"支持这一功能。可用它更精确地描述张量含义，使导出流水线更易于检查、验证和集成到部署系统。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp.rst:249
msgid ""
"Refer to the `LEAPP semantic annotation guide <https://nvidia-"
"isaac.github.io/leapp/semantics/usage.html>`_ and `LEAPP API reference "
"<https://nvidia-isaac.github.io/leapp/api/index.html>`_ for details on "
"authoring semantic annotations."
msgstr ""
"语义标注的编写方法，见 `LEAPP 语义标注指南 <https://nvidia-"
"isaac.github.io/leapp/semantics/usage.html>`_ 及 `LEAPP API 参考 "
"<https://nvidia-isaac.github.io/leapp/api/index.html>`_ 。"
